      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why would his race make him more trustworthy though? Is that a standard in legal analysis or just a perception? I'm also wondering if you think the way Witness B talks—like using \"chilling\" and \"ya know\"—makes him less reliable in a courtroom setting compared to someone in a suit?",
